# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Equivalence of the representations"
msgstr "Ekuivalensi representasi"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore operatorname */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore orthogonalization */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore vectorizing */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore bilinearity */}\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* cspell:ignore operatorname */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore orthogonalization */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore vectorizing */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore bilinearity */}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We've now discussed three different ways to represent channels in mathematical terms, namely Stinespring representations, Kraus representations, and Choi representations.\n"
"We also have the definition of a channel, which states that a channel is a linear mapping that always transforms density matrices into density matrices, even when the channel is applied to just part of a compound system.\n"
"The remainder of the lesson is devoted to a mathematical proof that the three representations are equivalent and precisely capture the definition.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sudah membahas tiga cara berbeda untuk merepresentasikan channel secara matematis, yaitu representasi Stinespring, representasi Kraus, dan representasi Choi.\n"
"Kita juga punya definisi channel, yang menyatakan bahwa channel adalah pemetaan linear yang selalu mengubah matriks densitas menjadi matriks densitas, bahkan ketika channel diterapkan hanya pada sebagian dari sistem gabungan.\n"
"Sisa pelajaran ini didedikasikan untuk bukti matematis bahwa ketiga representasi tersebut ekuivalen dan secara tepat menangkap definisi tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of the proof {#overview-of-the-proof}"
msgstr "Ikhtisar pembuktian {#overview-of-the-proof}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our goal is to establish the equivalence of a collection of four statements, and we'll begin by writing them down precisely.\n"
"All four statements follow the same conventions that have been used throughout the lesson, namely that $\\Phi$ is a linear mapping from square matrices to square matrices, the rows and columns of the input matrices have been placed in correspondence with the classical states of a system $\\mathsf{X}$ (the input system), and the rows and columns of the output matrices have been placed in correspondence with the classical states of a system $\\mathsf{Y}$ (the output system).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tujuan kita adalah membuktikan ekuivalensi dari sekumpulan empat pernyataan, dan kita akan mulai dengan menuliskannya secara tepat.\n"
"Keempat pernyataan mengikuti konvensi yang sama yang telah digunakan sepanjang pelajaran, yaitu bahwa $\\Phi$ adalah pemetaan linear dari matriks persegi ke matriks persegi, baris dan kolom matriks input telah ditempatkan sesuai dengan state klasik sistem $\\mathsf{X}$ (sistem input), dan baris dan kolom matriks output telah ditempatkan sesuai dengan state klasik sistem $\\mathsf{Y}$ (sistem output).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$\\Phi$ is a channel from $\\mathsf{X}$ to $\\mathsf{Y}.$ That is, $\\Phi$ "
"always transforms density matrices to density matrices, even when it acts on"
" one part of a larger compound system.\n"
msgstr ""
"$\\Phi$ adalah channel dari $\\mathsf{X}$ ke $\\mathsf{Y}.$ Artinya, $\\Phi$"
" selalu mengubah matriks densitas menjadi matriks densitas, bahkan ketika ia"
" bertindak pada satu bagian dari sistem gabungan yang lebih besar.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Choi matrix $J(\\Phi)$ is positive semidefinite and satisfies the "
"condition $\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi)) = "
"\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Matriks Choi $J(\\Phi)$ adalah positif semidefinit dan memenuhi kondisi "
"$\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is a Kraus representation for $\\Phi.$ That is, there exist matrices "
"$A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ for which the equation $\\Phi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = "
"0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}$ is true for every input $\\rho,$ and that"
" satisfy the condition $\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = "
"\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Ada representasi Kraus untuk $\\Phi.$ Artinya, ada matriks "
"$A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ yang membuat persamaan $\\Phi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = "
"0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}$ berlaku untuk setiap input $\\rho,$ dan "
"memenuhi kondisi $\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = "
"\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is a Stinespring representation for $\\Phi.$ That is, there exist "
"systems $\\mathsf{W}$ and $\\mathsf{G}$ for which the pairs "
"$(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ and $(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y})$ have the same "
"number of classical states, along with a unitary matrix $U$ representing a "
"unitary operation from $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ to "
"$(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y}),$ such that $\\Phi(\\rho) = "
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}}\\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert"
" \\otimes \\rho) U^{\\dagger} \\bigr).$\n"
msgstr ""
"Ada representasi Stinespring untuk $\\Phi.$ Artinya, ada sistem "
"$\\mathsf{W}$ dan $\\mathsf{G}$ yang membuat pasangan "
"$(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ dan $(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y})$ memiliki jumlah "
"state klasik yang sama, bersama dengan matriks uniter $U$ yang "
"merepresentasikan operasi uniter dari $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ ke "
"$(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y}),$ sehingga $\\Phi(\\rho) = "
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}}\\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert"
" \\otimes \\rho) U^{\\dagger} \\bigr).$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The way the proof works is that a cycle of implications is proved:\n"
"the first statement in our list implies the second, the second implies the third, the third implies the fourth, and the fourth statement implies the first.\n"
"This establishes that all four statements are equivalent — which is to say that they're either all true or all false for a given choice of $\\Phi$ — because the implications can be followed transitively from any one statement to any other.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara pembuktian bekerja adalah dengan membuktikan siklus implikasi:\n"
"pernyataan pertama dalam daftar kita mengimplikasikan yang kedua, yang kedua mengimplikasikan yang ketiga, yang ketiga mengimplikasikan yang keempat, dan pernyataan keempat mengimplikasikan yang pertama.\n"
"Ini membuktikan bahwa keempat pernyataan tersebut ekuivalen — artinya semuanya benar atau semuanya salah untuk pilihan $\\Phi$ tertentu — karena implikasi dapat diikuti secara transitif dari satu pernyataan ke pernyataan lainnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is a common strategy when proving that a collection of statements are equivalent, and a useful trick to use in such a context is to set up the implications in a way that makes them as easy to prove as possible.\n"
"That is the case here — and in fact we've already encountered two of the four implications.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah strategi umum ketika membuktikan bahwa sekumpulan pernyataan ekuivalen, dan trik yang berguna dalam konteks seperti ini adalah menyusun implikasi dengan cara yang membuatnya semudah mungkin untuk dibuktikan.\n"
"Itulah yang terjadi di sini — dan bahkan kita sudah menemui dua dari empat implikasi tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Channels to Choi matrices {#channels-to-choi-matrices}"
msgstr "Channel ke matriks Choi {#channels-to-choi-matrices}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Referring to the statements listed above by their numbers, the first implication to be proved is 1 $\\Rightarrow$ 2.\n"
"This implication was already discussed in the context of the Choi state of a channel.\n"
"Here we'll summarize the mathematical details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengacu pada pernyataan yang tercantum di atas berdasarkan nomornya, implikasi pertama yang perlu dibuktikan adalah 1 $\\Rightarrow$ 2.\n"
"Implikasi ini sudah dibahas dalam konteks state Choi dari suatu channel.\n"
"Di sini kita akan merangkum detail matematisnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Assume that the classical state set of the input system $\\mathsf{X}$ is $\\Sigma$ and let $n = \\vert\\Sigma\\vert.$\n"
"Consider the situation in which $\\Phi$ is applied to the second of two copies of $\\mathsf{X}$ together in the state\n"
msgstr ""
"Asumsikan bahwa himpunan state klasik dari sistem input $\\mathsf{X}$ adalah $\\Sigma$ dan misalkan $n = \\vert\\Sigma\\vert.$\n"
"Perhatikan situasi di mana $\\Phi$ diterapkan pada yang kedua dari dua salinan $\\mathsf{X}$ yang bersama-sama berada dalam state\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}} \\sum_{a \\in \\Sigma} \\vert a \\rangle \\otimes \\vert a \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}} \\sum_{a \\in \\Sigma} \\vert a \\rangle \\otimes \\vert a \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "which, as a density matrix, is given by\n"
msgstr "yang, sebagai matriks densitas, diberikan oleh\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert = \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{a,b \\in \\Sigma}\n"
"\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert = \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{a,b \\in \\Sigma}\n"
"\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The result can be written as\n"
msgstr "Hasilnya dapat ditulis sebagai\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"(\\operatorname{Id}\\otimes \\,\\Phi) \\bigl(\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert\\bigr)\n"
"= \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{a,b = 0}^{n-1} \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\Phi\\bigl(\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\bigr)\n"
"= \\frac{J(\\Phi)}{n},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"(\\operatorname{Id}\\otimes \\,\\Phi) \\bigl(\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert\\bigr)\n"
"= \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{a,b = 0}^{n-1} \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\Phi\\bigl(\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\bigr)\n"
"= \\frac{J(\\Phi)}{n},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and by the assumption that $\\Phi$ is a channel this must be a density matrix.\n"
"Like all density matrices it must be positive semidefinite, and multiplying a positive semidefinite matrix by a positive real number yields another positive semidefinite matrix, and therefore $J(\\Phi) \\geq 0.$\n"
msgstr ""
"dan berdasarkan asumsi bahwa $\\Phi$ adalah channel, ini harus menjadi matriks densitas.\n"
"Seperti semua matriks densitas, ia harus positif semidefinit, dan mengalikan matriks positif semidefinit dengan bilangan real positif menghasilkan matriks positif semidefinit lainnya, dan oleh karena itu $J(\\Phi) \\geq 0.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Moreover, under the assumption that $\\Phi$ is a channel, it must preserve "
"trace, and therefore\n"
msgstr ""
"Lebih lanjut, dengan asumsi bahwa $\\Phi$ adalah channel, ia harus "
"mempertahankan trace, dan oleh karena itu\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi))\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\Phi( \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert)\\bigr) \\, \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\bigr) \\, \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi))\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\Phi( \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert)\\bigr) \\, \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\bigr) \\, \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Choi to Kraus representations {#choi-to-kraus-representations}"
msgstr "Choi ke representasi Kraus {#choi-to-kraus-representations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The second implication, again referring to the statements in our list by their numbers, is 2 $\\Rightarrow$ 3.\n"
"To be clear, we're ignoring the other statements — and in particular we cannot make the assumption that $\\Phi$ is a channel.\n"
"All we have to work with is that $\\Phi$ is a linear mapping whose Choi representation satisfies $J(\\Phi) \\geq 0$ and\n"
"$\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This, however, is all we need to conclude that $\\Phi$ has a Kraus "
"representation\n"
msgstr ""
"Implikasi kedua, lagi-lagi mengacu pada pernyataan dalam daftar kita berdasarkan nomornya, adalah 2 $\\Rightarrow$ 3.\n"
"Untuk jelasnya, kita mengabaikan pernyataan lain — dan khususnya kita tidak bisa membuat asumsi bahwa $\\Phi$ adalah channel.\n"
"Satu-satunya yang kita miliki adalah bahwa $\\Phi$ adalah pemetaan linear yang representasi Choi-nya memenuhi $J(\\Phi) \\geq 0$ dan\n"
"$\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Phi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Namun, ini saja sudah cukup untuk menyimpulkan bahwa $\\Phi$ memiliki "
"representasi Kraus\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for which the condition\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Phi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "yang memenuhi kondisi\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "is satisfied.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We begin with the critically important assumption that $J(\\Phi)$ is "
"positive semidefinite, which means that it is possible to express it in the "
"form\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita mulai dengan asumsi yang sangat penting bahwa $J(\\Phi)$ adalah positif"
" semidefinit, yang berarti kita bisa mengekspresikannya dalam bentuk\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for some way of choosing the vectors $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle.$\n"
"In general there will be multiple ways to do this — and in fact this directly mirrors the freedom one has in choosing a Kraus representation for $\\Phi.$\n"
msgstr ""
"untuk beberapa cara memilih vektor $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle.$\n"
"Pada umumnya ada beberapa cara untuk melakukan ini — dan bahkan ini secara langsung mencerminkan kebebasan yang dimiliki dalam memilih representasi Kraus untuk $\\Phi.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"One way to obtain such an expression is to first use the spectral theorem to"
" write\n"
msgstr ""
"Salah satu cara untuk mendapatkan ekspresi seperti itu adalah dengan pertama"
" menggunakan teorema spektral untuk menulis\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\lambda_k \\vert \\gamma_k \\rangle \\langle \\gamma_k \\vert,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\lambda_k \\vert \\gamma_k \\rangle \\langle \\gamma_k \\vert,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"in which $\\lambda_0,\\ldots,\\lambda_{N-1}$ are the eigenvalues of "
"$J(\\Phi)$ (which are necessarily nonnegative real numbers because "
"$J(\\Phi)$ is positive semidefinite) and "
"$\\vert\\gamma_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\gamma_{N-1}\\rangle$ are unit "
"eigenvectors corresponding to the eigenvalues "
"$\\lambda_0,\\ldots,\\lambda_{N-1}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $\\lambda_0,\\ldots,\\lambda_{N-1}$ adalah nilai eigen dari "
"$J(\\Phi)$ (yang tentu saja merupakan bilangan real non-negatif karena "
"$J(\\Phi)$ adalah positif semidefinit) dan "
"$\\vert\\gamma_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\gamma_{N-1}\\rangle$ adalah vektor "
"eigen satuan yang bersesuaian dengan nilai eigen "
"$\\lambda_0,\\ldots,\\lambda_{N-1}.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that, while there's no freedom in choosing the eigenvalues (except for how they're ordered), there is freedom in the choice of the eigenvectors, particularly when there are eigenvalues with multiplicity larger than one.\n"
"So, this is not a unique expression of $J(\\Phi)$ — we're just assuming we have one such expression.\n"
"Regardless, because the eigenvalues are nonnegative real numbers, they have nonnegative square roots, and so we can select\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa, meskipun tidak ada kebebasan dalam memilih nilai eigen (kecuali bagaimana urutannya), ada kebebasan dalam pemilihan vektor eigen, terutama ketika ada nilai eigen dengan multiplisitas lebih dari satu.\n"
"Jadi, ini bukan ekspresi unik dari $J(\\Phi)$ — kita hanya mengasumsikan kita punya satu ekspresi seperti itu.\n"
"Terlepas dari itu, karena nilai eigen adalah bilangan real non-negatif, nilai tersebut memiliki akar kuadrat non-negatif, sehingga kita bisa memilih\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\lambda_k} \\vert \\gamma_k\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\lambda_k} \\vert \\gamma_k\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for each $k = 0,\\ldots,N-1$ to obtain an expression of the form $(1).$\n"
msgstr ""
"untuk setiap $k = 0,\\ldots,N-1$ untuk mendapatkan ekspresi dalam bentuk "
"$(1).$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is, however, not essential that the expression $(1)$ comes from a spectral decomposition in this way, and in particular the vectors $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ need not be orthogonal in general.\n"
"It is noteworthy, though, that we can choose these vectors to be orthogonal if we wish — and moreover we never need $N$ to be larger than $nm$\n"
"(recalling that $n$ and $m$ denote the numbers of classical states of $\\mathsf{X}$ and $\\mathsf{Y},$ respectively).\n"
msgstr ""
"Namun, tidak harus bahwa ekspresi $(1)$ berasal dari dekomposisi spektral dengan cara ini, dan khususnya vektor $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ tidak perlu ortogonal secara umum.\n"
"Patut dicatat, meskipun demikian, bahwa kita bisa memilih vektor-vektor ini agar ortogonal jika kita mau — dan terlebih lagi kita tidak pernah perlu $N$ lebih besar dari $nm$\n"
"(mengingat bahwa $n$ dan $m$ menandakan jumlah state klasik dari $\\mathsf{X}$ dan $\\mathsf{Y},$ masing-masing).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, each of the vectors "
"$\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ can be further "
"decomposed as\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, masing-masing vektor "
"$\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ dapat "
"didekomposisi lebih lanjut sebagai\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the vectors $\\{ \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle \\}$ have entries "
"corresponding to the classical states of $\\mathsf{Y}$ and can be explicitly"
" determined by the equation\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana vektor $\\{ \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle \\}$ memiliki entri yang "
"bersesuaian dengan state klasik dari $\\mathsf{Y}$ dan dapat ditentukan "
"secara eksplisit oleh persamaan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle = \\bigl( \\langle a \\vert \\otimes \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{Y}}\\bigr) \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle = \\bigl( \\langle a \\vert \\otimes \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{Y}}\\bigr) \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for each $a\\in\\Sigma$ and $k=0,\\ldots,N-1.$\n"
"Although $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ are not necessarily unit vectors, this is the same process we would use to analyze what would happen if a standard basis measurement was performed on the system $\\mathsf{X}$ given a quantum state vector of the pair $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}).$\n"
msgstr ""
"untuk setiap $a\\in\\Sigma$ dan $k=0,\\ldots,N-1.$\n"
"Meskipun $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ tidak harus vektor satuan, ini adalah proses yang sama yang kita gunakan untuk menganalisis apa yang akan terjadi jika pengukuran basis standar dilakukan pada sistem $\\mathsf{X}$ dengan vektor state kuantum yang diberikan dari pasangan $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}).$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And now we come to the trick that makes this part of the proof work.\n"
"We define our Kraus matrices $A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ according to the following equation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dan sekarang kita sampai pada trik yang membuat bagian ini dari pembuktian berhasil.\n"
"Kita mendefinisikan matriks Kraus $A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ sesuai persamaan berikut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"A_k = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"A_k = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can think about this formula purely symbolically: $\\vert a\\rangle$ effectively gets flipped around to form $\\langle a\\vert$ and moved to right-hand side, forming a matrix.\n"
"For the purposes of verifying the proof, the formula is all we need.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita bisa memikirkan rumus ini secara simbolis murni: $\\vert a\\rangle$ secara efektif dibalik menjadi $\\langle a\\vert$ dan dipindahkan ke sisi kanan, membentuk suatu matriks.\n"
"Untuk keperluan memverifikasi pembuktian, rumusnya saja sudah cukup.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is, however, a simple and intuitive relationship between the vector $\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle$ and the matrix $A_k,$ which is that by *vectorizing* $A_k$ we get $\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle.$\n"
"What it means to vectorize $A_k$ is that we stack the columns on top of one another (with the leftmost column on top proceeding to the rightmost on the bottom), in order to form a vector.\n"
"For instance, if $\\mathsf{X}$ and $\\mathsf{Y}$ are both qubits, and for some choice of $k$ we have\n"
msgstr ""
"Namun, ada hubungan yang sederhana dan intuitif antara vektor $\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle$ dan matriks $A_k,$ yaitu dengan *memvektorkan* $A_k$ kita mendapatkan $\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle.$\n"
"Yang dimaksud dengan memvektorkan $A_k$ adalah menumpuk kolom-kolomnya satu di atas yang lain (dengan kolom paling kiri di atas dilanjutkan hingga yang paling kanan di bawah), untuk membentuk sebuah vektor.\n"
"Misalnya, jika $\\mathsf{X}$ dan $\\mathsf{Y}$ keduanya adalah Qubit, dan untuk beberapa pilihan $k$ kita punya\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle & = \\alpha_{00} \\vert 0\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 0\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\vert 0\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 1\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\vert 1\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 0\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{11} \\vert 1\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 1\\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{00} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{11}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle & = \\alpha_{00} \\vert 0\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 0\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\vert 0\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 1\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\vert 1\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 0\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{11} \\vert 1\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 1\\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{00} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{11}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "then\n"
msgstr "maka\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"A_k & = \\alpha_{00} \\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\vert 1\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 1\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{11} \\vert 1\\rangle\\langle 1\\vert\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{00} & \\alpha_{10}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{01} & \\alpha_{11}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"A_k & = \\alpha_{00} \\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\vert 1\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 1\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{11} \\vert 1\\rangle\\langle 1\\vert\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{00} & \\alpha_{10}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{01} & \\alpha_{11}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(Beware: sometimes the vectorization of a matrix is defined in a slightly "
"different way, which is that the *rows* of the matrix are transposed and "
"stacked on top of one another to form a column vector.)\n"
msgstr ""
"(Perhatian: kadang-kadang vektorisasi suatu matriks didefinisikan dengan "
"cara yang sedikit berbeda, yaitu *baris-baris* matriks ditranspose dan "
"ditumpuk satu di atas yang lain untuk membentuk vektor kolom.)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First we'll verify that this choice of Kraus matrices correctly describes the mapping $\\Phi,$ after which we'll verify the other required condition.\n"
"To keep things straight, let's define a new mapping $\\Psi$ as follows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama kita akan memverifikasi bahwa pilihan matriks Kraus ini secara benar mendeskripsikan pemetaan $\\Phi,$ setelah itu kita akan memverifikasi kondisi lain yang diperlukan.\n"
"Untuk membuatnya jelas, mari kita definisikan pemetaan baru $\\Psi$ sebagai berikut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Psi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Psi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, our goal is to verify that $\\Psi = \\Phi.$\n"
msgstr "Dengan demikian, tujuan kita adalah memverifikasi bahwa $\\Psi = \\Phi.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The way we can do this is to compare the Choi representations of these mappings.\n"
"Choi representations are faithful, so we have $\\Psi = \\Phi$ if and only if $J(\\Phi) = J(\\Psi).$\n"
"At this point we can simply compute $J(\\Psi)$ using the expressions\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara kita melakukan ini adalah dengan membandingkan representasi Choi dari pemetaan-pemetaan ini.\n"
"Representasi Choi adalah faithful, sehingga kita punya $\\Psi = \\Phi$ jika dan hanya jika $J(\\Phi) = J(\\Psi).$\n"
"Pada titik ini kita bisa langsung menghitung $J(\\Psi)$ menggunakan ekspresi\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"A_k = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"A_k = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "together with the bilinearity of tensor products to simplify.\n"
msgstr "bersama dengan bilinearitas produk tensor untuk menyederhanakan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"J(\\Psi) & = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma}  \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert A_k^{\\dagger}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma}  \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1}  \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\biggl(\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle b\\vert \\otimes \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert\\biggr)\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = J(\\Phi)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"J(\\Psi) & = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma}  \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert A_k^{\\dagger}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma}  \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1}  \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\biggl(\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle b\\vert \\otimes \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert\\biggr)\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = J(\\Phi)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "So, our Kraus matrices correctly describe $\\Phi.$\n"
msgstr "Jadi, matriks Kraus kita secara benar mendeskripsikan $\\Phi.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It remains to check the required condition on $A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1},$ which turns out to be equivalent to the assumption $\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}$ (which we haven't used yet).\n"
"What we'll show is this relationship:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tersisa untuk memeriksa kondisi yang diperlukan pada $A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1},$ yang ternyata ekuivalen dengan asumsi $\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}$ (yang belum kita gunakan).\n"
"Yang akan kita tunjukkan adalah hubungan ini:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Biggl( \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k \\Biggr)^{T} = \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi))\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Biggl( \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k \\Biggr)^{T} = \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi))\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(in which we're referring the *matrix transpose* on the left-hand side).\n"
msgstr "(di mana kita mengacu pada *transpose matriks* di sisi kiri).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Starting on the left, we can first observe that\n"
msgstr "Mulai dari kiri, kita bisa pertama mengamati bahwa\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k\\Biggr)^T\n"
"& = \\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\vert b \\rangle \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\langle a \\vert\\Biggr)^T\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle  \\langle b \\vert.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k\\Biggr)^T\n"
"& = \\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\vert b \\rangle \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\langle a \\vert\\Biggr)^T\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle  \\langle b \\vert.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The last equality follows from the fact that the transpose is linear and "
"maps $\\vert b\\rangle\\langle a \\vert$ to $\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b "
"\\vert.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Kesetaraan terakhir mengikuti dari fakta bahwa transpose adalah linear dan "
"memetakan $\\vert b\\rangle\\langle a \\vert$ ke $\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b"
" \\vert.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Moving to the right-hand side of our equation, we have\n"
msgstr "Beralih ke sisi kanan persamaan kita, kita punya\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k \\vert\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\vert\\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k \\vert\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\vert\\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and therefore\n"
msgstr "dan oleh karena itu\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi))\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert\\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\bigr)\\,\n"
"\\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle  \\langle b \\vert.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi))\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert\\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\bigr)\\,\n"
"\\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle  \\langle b \\vert.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We've obtained the same result, and therefore the equation $(2)$ has been verified.\n"
"It follows, by the assumption $\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}},$ that\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita mendapatkan hasil yang sama, dan oleh karena itu persamaan $(2)$ telah diverifikasi.\n"
"Dari asumsi $\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}},$ maka\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k\\Biggr)^T = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k\\Biggr)^T = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and therefore, because the identity matrix is its own transpose, the "
"required condition is true.\n"
msgstr ""
"dan oleh karena itu, karena matriks identitas adalah transposenya sendiri, "
"kondisi yang diperlukan terpenuhi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Kraus to Stinespring representations {#kraus-to-stinespring-representations}"
msgstr ""
"Kraus ke representasi Stinespring {#kraus-to-stinespring-representations}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Now suppose that we have a Kraus representation of a mapping\n"
msgstr "Sekarang misalkan kita punya representasi Kraus dari sebuah pemetaan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for which\n"
msgstr "yang memenuhi\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Our goal is to find a Stinespring representation for $\\Phi.$\n"
msgstr "Tujuan kita adalah menemukan representasi Stinespring untuk $\\Phi.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What we'd like to do first is to choose the garbage system $\\mathsf{G}$ so that its classical state set is $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"For $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ and $(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y})$ to have the same size, however, it must be that\n"
"$n$ divides $m N,$ allowing us to take $\\mathsf{W}$ to have classical states $\\{0,\\ldots,d-1\\}$ for $d = mN/n.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Yang pertama ingin kita lakukan adalah memilih sistem sampah $\\mathsf{G}$ sehingga himpunan state klasiknya adalah $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"Namun agar $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ dan $(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y})$ punya ukuran yang sama, harus berlaku bahwa\n"
"$n$ membagi $m N,$ sehingga kita bisa mengambil $\\mathsf{W}$ dengan state klasik $\\{0,\\ldots,d-1\\}$ untuk $d = mN/n.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For an arbitrary choice of $n,$ $m,$ and $N,$ it may not be the case that $mN/n$ is an integer, so we're not actually free to choose $\\mathsf{G}$ so that it's classical state set is $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"But we can always increase $N$ arbitrarily in the Kraus representation by choosing $A_k = 0$ for however many additional values of $k$ that we wish.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk pilihan $n,$ $m,$ dan $N$ yang sembarang, bisa saja $mN/n$ bukan bilangan bulat, jadi kita tidak bebas memilih $\\mathsf{G}$ sehingga himpunan state klasiknya adalah $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"Tapi kita selalu bisa menambah $N$ secara sembarang dalam representasi Kraus dengan memilih $A_k = 0$ untuk berapapun nilai tambahan $k$ yang kita inginkan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"So, if we tacitly assume that $mN/n$ is an integer, which is equivalent to $N$ being a multiple of $n/\\operatorname{gcd}(n,m),$ then we're free to take $\\mathsf{G}$ so that its classical state set is $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"In particular, if it is the case that $N = nm,$ then we may take $\\mathsf{W}$ to have $m^2$ classical states.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jadi, jika kita secara diam-diam mengasumsikan bahwa $mN/n$ adalah bilangan bulat, yang setara dengan $N$ merupakan kelipatan dari $n/\\operatorname{gcd}(n,m),$ maka kita bebas mengambil $\\mathsf{G}$ sehingga himpunan state klasiknya adalah $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"Secara khusus, jika $N = nm,$ maka kita bisa mengambil $\\mathsf{W}$ dengan $m^2$ state klasik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It remains to choose $U,$ and we'll do this by matching the following "
"pattern.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tinggal memilih $U,$ dan kita akan melakukannya dengan mencocokkan pola "
"berikut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"A_{0} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{N-1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"A_{0} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{N-1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To be clear, this pattern is meant to suggest a block matrix, where each block (including $A_{0},\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ as well as the blocks marked with a question mark) has $m$ rows and $n$ columns.\n"
"There are $N$ rows of blocks, which means that there are $d = mN/n$ columns of blocks.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk lebih jelasnya, pola ini dimaksudkan untuk menggambarkan matriks blok, di mana setiap blok (termasuk $A_{0},\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ maupun blok-blok yang ditandai tanda tanya) punya $m$ baris dan $n$ kolom.\n"
"Ada $N$ baris blok, yang berarti ada $d = mN/n$ kolom blok.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Expressed in more formulaic terms, we will define $U$ as\n"
msgstr "Dalam bentuk yang lebih formal, kita akan mendefinisikan $U$ sebagai\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"U & = \\sum_{k=0}^{N-1} \\sum_{j=0}^{d-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\langle j \\vert \\otimes M_{k,j} \\\\[4mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"M_{0,0} & M_{0,1} & \\cdots & M_{0,d-1} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"M_{1,0} & M_{1,1} & \\cdots & M_{1,d-1} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"M_{N-1,0} & M_{N-1,1} & \\cdots & M_{N-1,d-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"U & = \\sum_{k=0}^{N-1} \\sum_{j=0}^{d-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\langle j \\vert \\otimes M_{k,j} \\\\[4mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"M_{0,0} & M_{0,1} & \\cdots & M_{0,d-1} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"M_{1,0} & M_{1,1} & \\cdots & M_{1,d-1} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"M_{N-1,0} & M_{N-1,1} & \\cdots & M_{N-1,d-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where each matrix $M_{k,j}$ has $m$ rows and $n$ columns, and in particular "
"we shall take $M_{k,0} = A_k$ for $k = 0,\\ldots,N-1.$\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana setiap matriks $M_{k,j}$ punya $m$ baris dan $n$ kolom, dan secara "
"khusus kita ambil $M_{k,0} = A_k$ untuk $k = 0,\\ldots,N-1.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This must be a unitary matrix, and the blocks labeled with a question mark, "
"or equivalently $M_{k,j}$ for $j>0,$ must be selected with this in mind — "
"but aside from allowing $U$ to be unitary, the blocks labeled with a "
"question mark won't have any relevance to the proof.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini harus merupakan matriks uniter, dan blok-blok yang ditandai tanda tanya,"
" atau ekuivalennya $M_{k,j}$ untuk $j>0,$ harus dipilih dengan "
"mempertimbangkan hal ini — tapi selain memungkinkan $U$ menjadi uniter, "
"blok-blok yang ditandai tanda tanya tidak akan relevan untuk pembuktian.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's momentarily disregard the concern that $U$ is unitary and focus on the"
" expression\n"
msgstr ""
"Mari sejenak kita abaikan kekhawatiran bahwa $U$ adalah uniter dan fokus "
"pada ekspresi\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"that describes the output state of $\\mathsf{Y}$ given the input state $\\rho$ of $\\mathsf{X}$ for our Stinespring representation.\n"
"We can alternatively write\n"
msgstr ""
"yang menggambarkan state keluaran dari $\\mathsf{Y}$ dengan state masukan $\\rho$ dari $\\mathsf{X}$ untuk representasi Stinespring kita.\n"
"Kita bisa menulis ulang\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\n"
"= U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\otimes\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) \\rho (\\langle 0\\vert \\otimes \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) U^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\n"
"= U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\otimes\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) \\rho (\\langle 0\\vert \\otimes \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) U^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and we see from our choice of $U$ that\n"
msgstr "dan dari pilihan $U$ kita, terlihat bahwa\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\otimes\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes A_k.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\otimes\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes A_k.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We therefore find that\n"
msgstr "Kita pun mendapatkan bahwa\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle\\langle j\\vert \\otimes A_k \\rho A_j^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle\\langle j\\vert \\otimes A_k \\rho A_j^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and so\n"
msgstr "sehingga\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho) U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"& = \\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert k\\rangle\\langle j\\vert\\bigr) \\, A_k \\rho A_j^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"& = \\Phi(\\rho).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho) U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"& = \\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert k\\rangle\\langle j\\vert\\bigr) \\, A_k \\rho A_j^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"& = \\Phi(\\rho).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We therefore have a correct representation for the mapping $\\Phi,$ and it "
"remains to verify that we can choose $U$ to be unitary.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita pun mendapatkan representasi yang benar untuk pemetaan $\\Phi,$ dan "
"tinggal memverifikasi bahwa kita bisa memilih $U$ agar uniter.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Consider the first $n$ columns of $U$ when it's selected according to the pattern above.\n"
"Taking these columns alone, we have a block matrix\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan $n$ kolom pertama dari $U$ saat dipilih sesuai pola di atas.\n"
"Mengambil kolom-kolom tersebut saja, kita punya matriks blok\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"A_0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_1\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{N-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"A_0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_1\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{N-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are $n$ columns, one for each classical state of $\\mathsf{X},$ and as vectors let us name the columns as $\\vert \\gamma_a \\rangle$ for each $a\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
"Here's a formula for these vectors that can be matched to the block matrix representation above.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ada $n$ kolom, satu untuk setiap state klasik dari $\\mathsf{X},$ dan sebagai vektor mari kita namai kolom-kolom tersebut sebagai $\\vert \\gamma_a \\rangle$ untuk setiap $a\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
"Berikut formula untuk vektor-vektor ini yang bisa dicocokkan dengan representasi matriks blok di atas.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\gamma_a\\rangle = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes A_k \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\gamma_a\\rangle = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes A_k \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's compute the inner product between any two of these vectors, "
"meaning the ones corresponding to any choice of $a,b\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang mari kita hitung hasil kali dalam antara dua vektor ini, yaitu yang"
" bersesuaian dengan pilihan $a,b\\in\\Sigma$ yang sembarang.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\gamma_a \\vert \\gamma_b \\rangle =\n"
"\\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\langle k \\vert j \\rangle \\, \\langle a \\vert A_k^{\\dagger} A_j \\vert b\\rangle =\n"
"\\langle a \\vert \\Biggl( \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k \\Biggr) \\vert b\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\gamma_a \\vert \\gamma_b \\rangle =\n"
"\\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\langle k \\vert j \\rangle \\, \\langle a \\vert A_k^{\\dagger} A_j \\vert b\\rangle =\n"
"\\langle a \\vert \\Biggl( \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k \\Biggr) \\vert b\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "By the assumption\n"
msgstr "Berdasarkan asumsi\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"we conclude that the $n$ column vectors "
"$\\{\\vert\\gamma_a\\rangle\\,:\\,a\\in\\Sigma\\}$ form an orthonormal "
"set:\n"
msgstr ""
"kita simpulkan bahwa $n$ vektor kolom "
"$\\{\\vert\\gamma_a\\rangle\\,:\\,a\\in\\Sigma\\}$ membentuk himpunan "
"ortonormal:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\gamma_a \\vert \\gamma_b \\rangle = \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & a = b\\\\\n"
"0 & a\\neq b\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\gamma_a \\vert \\gamma_b \\rangle = \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & a = b\\\\\n"
"0 & a\\neq b\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for all $a,b\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
msgstr "untuk semua $a,b\\in\\Sigma.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This implies that it is possible to fill out the remaining columns of $U$ so that it becomes a unitary matrix.\n"
"In particular, the Gram-Schmidt orthogonalization process can be used to select the remaining columns.\n"
"Something similar was done in the *Quantum circuits* lesson of \"Basics of quantum information\" in the context of the state discrimination problem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini menunjukkan bahwa kita bisa melengkapi kolom-kolom $U$ yang tersisa agar menjadi matriks uniter.\n"
"Secara khusus, proses ortogonalisasi Gram-Schmidt bisa digunakan untuk memilih kolom-kolom yang tersisa.\n"
"Hal serupa pernah dilakukan dalam pelajaran *Quantum circuits* dari \"Basics of quantum information\" dalam konteks masalah diskriminasi state.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Stinespring representations back to the definition {#stinespring-"
"representations-back-to-the-definition}"
msgstr ""
"Representasi Stinespring kembali ke definisi {#stinespring-representations-"
"back-to-the-definition}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The final implication is 4 $\\Rightarrow$ 1.\n"
"That is, we assume that we have a unitary operation transforming a pair of systems $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ into a pair\n"
"$(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y}),$ and our goal is to conclude that the mapping\n"
msgstr ""
"Implikasi terakhir adalah 4 $\\Rightarrow$ 1.\n"
"Artinya, kita mengasumsikan bahwa kita punya operasi uniter yang mentransformasi sepasang sistem $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ menjadi sepasang sistem\n"
"$(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y}),$ dan tujuan kita adalah menyimpulkan bahwa pemetaan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Phi(\\rho) = \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Phi(\\rho) = \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"is a valid channel.\n"
"From its form, it is evident that $\\Phi$ is linear, and it remains to verify that it always transforms density matrices into density matrices.\n"
"This is pretty straightforward and we've already discussed the key points.\n"
msgstr ""
"adalah channel yang valid.\n"
"Dari bentuknya, jelas bahwa $\\Phi$ adalah linear, dan tinggal memverifikasi bahwa $\\Phi$ selalu mentransformasi matriks densitas menjadi matriks densitas.\n"
"Ini cukup mudah dan kita sudah membahas poin-poin kuncinya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In particular, if we start with a density matrix $\\sigma$ of a compound system $(\\mathsf{Z},\\mathsf{X}),$ and then add on an additional workspace system $\\mathsf{W},$ we will certainly be left with a density matrix.\n"
"If we reorder the systems $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{Z},\\mathsf{X})$ for convenience, we can write this state as\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara khusus, jika kita mulai dengan matriks densitas $\\sigma$ dari sistem majemuk $(\\mathsf{Z},\\mathsf{X}),$ lalu menambahkan sistem workspace tambahan $\\mathsf{W},$ kita pasti akan mendapatkan matriks densitas.\n"
"Jika kita mengurutkan ulang sistem $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{Z},\\mathsf{X})$ untuk kenyamanan, kita bisa menulis state ini sebagai\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\sigma.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\sigma.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We then apply the unitary operation $U,$ and as we already discussed this is a valid channel, and hence maps density matrices to density matrices.\n"
"Finally, the partial trace of a density matrix is another density matrix.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita kemudian menerapkan operasi uniter $U,$ dan seperti yang sudah kita bahas ini adalah channel yang valid, sehingga memetakan matriks densitas ke matriks densitas.\n"
"Akhirnya, jejak parsial dari matriks densitas adalah matriks densitas lainnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Another way to say this is to observe first that each of these things is a "
"valid channel:\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara lain untuk mengatakannya adalah dengan mengamati terlebih dahulu bahwa "
"setiap hal berikut adalah channel yang valid:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introducing an initialized workspace system.\n"
msgstr "Menambahkan sistem workspace yang sudah diinisialisasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Performing a unitary operation.\n"
msgstr "Melakukan operasi uniter.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Tracing out a system.\n"
msgstr "Men-trace out (menjejakkan keluar / partial trace) sebuah sistem.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And finally, any composition of channels is another channel — which is "
"immediate from the definition, but is also a fact worth observing in its own"
" right.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dan akhirnya, setiap komposisi channel adalah channel lainnya — yang "
"langsung mengikuti dari definisi, tapi juga merupakan fakta yang layak "
"diperhatikan tersendiri.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This completes the proof of the final implication, and therefore we've "
"established the equivalence of the four statements listed at the start of "
"the section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini melengkapi pembuktian implikasi terakhir, dan dengan demikian kita telah"
" membuktikan kesetaraan keempat pernyataan yang tercantum di awal bagian "
"ini.\n"
